  "body": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"Paragraph\">Northwind Tech is looking for a partner to join the data platform team as:</p><p class=\"ql-header-2\"><strong>Senior Data Engineer (B2B)</strong></p><p>We build the analytics platform behind the Northwind online store: ingestion from the shop and the warehouse, a modelled layer in the warehouse, and self-service reporting for the commercial teams.</p><h3>What you will do</h3><ul><li>Design and maintain batch pipelines in Python.</li><li>Model the warehouse layer with dbt and keep the tests green.</li><li>Review data contracts with the analytics engineers.</li></ul><h3>Requirements</h3><ul><li>5+ years with Python and SQL in production data work.</li><li>Hands-on experience with dbt and a columnar warehouse.</li><li>English at B2, Polish at C1.</li></ul><h3>Nice to have</h3><ul><li>Airflow, Terraform.</li></ul><p>Cooperation: B2B contract, 115 - 143 PLN/h + VAT.</p>",
